<text>
<p>Year ended August 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.3 loss  vs 7.3 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
